### Source comparison and exclusion decision

- Anthropic's official [models overview](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/models/overview) lists the current Sonnet as Claude Sonnet 5.5 and the legacy line as Claude Sonnet 5; it contains no Sonnet 5.4 entry or API ID.
- The independent [Artificial Analysis model catalog](https://artificialanalysis.ai/models) includes Claude Sonnet 5.5 among evaluated models but exposes no Claude Sonnet 5.4 result.
- OpenRouter's public [model catalog API](https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/models) yielded no independently verifiable exact-model benchmark or official identity for Claude Sonnet 5.4.
- Multiple exact-name searches, including official-domain, benchmark-domain, gateway, SWE-bench, Terminal-Bench, and GPQA queries, returned neighboring Claude releases rather than evidence for this exact label.
- Because the apparent identity conflict cannot be resolved without reading or borrowing peer reports, and zero verified benchmark numbers exist for the exact model, this report is self-excluded and contains no normalized scores.

